      "difficulty": "basic",
      "question": "以下 Python 代码的输出结果是什么？\\nnums = [1, 2, 3]\\nresult = []\\nfor x in nums:\\n    if x % 2 == 0:\\n        result.append(x * 2)\\nprint(result)",
