          "text": "[2, 4, 6]"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "[4]"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "[2, 6]"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "[]"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "循环遍历列表 nums，仅当 x 为偶数（x % 2 == 0）时执行 append；只有 x=2 满足条件，故 result = [2*2] = [4]。",
      "user_answer": "C",
      "correct": false,
      "attempts": 1,
      "created_at": "2026-08-20T21:01:49",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-20T21:01:49"
