      "type": "choice",
      "difficulty": "intermediate",
      "question": "执行以下代码后，变量 count 的值是多少？\\narr = [5, 3, 8, 3, 1]\\ncount = 0\\nfor i in range(len(arr)):\\n    if arr[i] > 4:\\n        count += 1\\n    elif arr[i] == 3:\\n        break",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "0"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "1"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "2"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "3"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "循环从 i=0 开始：arr[0]=5>4 → count=1；i=1：arr[1]=3==3 → 执行 break 退出循环，后续不执行，最终 count=1。",
      "user_answer": "B",
      "correct": true,
      "attempts": 1,
      "created_at": "2026-08-20T21:01:49",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-20T21:01:49"
