      "type": "choice",
      "difficulty": "intermediate",
      "question": "下列代码中，哪一项能正确统计列表中正数的个数？",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "count = 0\\nfor x in lst:\\n    if x > 0:\\n        count += 1"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "count = len([x for x in lst if x > 0])"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "count = sum(1 for x in lst if x > 0)"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "以上全部正确"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "D",
      "explanation": "A 使用基础循环+条件语句；B 使用列表推导式+len；C 使用生成器表达式+sum；三者均能正确统计正数个数。",
      "user_answer": "A",
      "correct": false,
      "attempts": 1,
      "created_at": "2026-08-20T21:01:49",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-20T21:01:49"
